<body>
    <header>
        <h1>=== My Favorite Pokemon ===</h1>
        <p>Three Unova legends I can’t stop thinking about, maybe.</p>
    </header>

    <main>
        <section>
            <h2>1. Reshiram</h2>
            <img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/643.png"
                alt="Reshiram, a white legendary dragon Pokemon" width="200">
            <p>
                Reshiram is a legendary Dragon and Fire-type Pokemon.
                It represents truth and has powerful fire abilities.
            </p>
            <h3>Reshiram's features</h3>
            <ul>
                <li>Type: Dragon and Fire</li>
                <li>Known for its soft and thick white fur appearance</li>
                <li>Uses powerful fire attacks and disagrees with Zekrom</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>2. Zekrom</h2>
            <img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/644.png"
                alt="Zekrom, a black legendary dragon Pokemon" width="200">
            <p>
                Zekrom is a legendary Dragon and Electric-type Pokemon.
                It represents ideals and controls electricity.
            </p>
            <ul>
                <li>Type: Dragon and Electric</li>
                <li>Has a black and metal-like body</li>
                <li>Uses powerful electric attacks, disagrees with Reshiram</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>3. Kyurem</h2>
            <img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/646.png"
                alt="Kyurem, a legendary Dragon and Ice-type Pokemon" width="200">
        
            <p>
                Kyurem is a legendary Dragon and Ice-type Pokemon.
                It is known for its icy appearance and mysterious power.
            </p>
        
            <ul>
                <li>Type: Dragon and Ice</li>
                <li>Has a powerful icy and empty body</li>
                <li>Can use powerful Ice-type attacks, "these two above won't stop fighting smh"</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>Conclusion :</h2>
            <p>
                These Pokemon are special in different ways.
                Reshiram is my favorite because of its dragon design and gorgeous white fur (not in the JustinRPG way).
            </p>
        </section>
    </main>

